{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"sko_1z7_fje_AA","canonical_person_id":"sko_1z7_fje_AA","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["sko_1z7_fje_AA"],"persons":[{"id":"sko_1z7_fje_A","aliases":[{"surface":"談先","mention_ids":["c-xintangshu-071xia-chen-preface:p001:m0400"]},{"surface":"始興昭烈王","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0003"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-xintangshu","book_id":"b-xintangshu-071-xia","chapter_id":"c-xintangshu-071xia-chen-preface","source_id":"s-xintangshu-071xia-chen-preface","paragraph_id":"c-xintangshu-071xia-chen-preface:p001","mention_id":"c-xintangshu-071xia-chen-preface:p001:m0400","quote":"談先"},{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-003","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","source_id":"s-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001","quote":"始興昭烈王","mention_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0003"}],"label":"談先〔新唐陳氏序〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","identity_note":"文讚三子談先；下一行真表第一格再出談先是另一實際位置，本研究未收該格，不偷增本段提及。 暫設來源指稱，不宣稱與既有同名字角色必為異人。 收到世系所指，跨篇未證不等同確定異人；無自動父系組裝。","family_path":{"parent_person_id":"sko_1z7_fje","connection":"father","source_assertion_id":"a-chen-near-chen_daotan-father-wenzan","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-xintangshu","book_id":"b-xintangshu-071-xia","chapter_id":"c-xintangshu-071xia-chen-preface","source_id":"s-xintangshu-071xia-chen-preface","paragraph_id":"c-xintangshu-071xia-chen-preface:p001","quote":"陳氏出自媯姓，虞帝舜之後。夏禹封舜子商均於虞城，三十二世孫遏父為周陶正，武王妻以元女大姬，生滿，封之於陳，賜姓媯，以奉舜祀，是為胡公。九世孫厲公他生敬仲完，奔齊，以國為姓。既而食邑於田，又為田氏。十五世孫齊王建為秦所滅。三子：昇、桓、軫。桓稱王氏。軫，楚相，封潁川侯，因徙潁川，稱陳氏。生嬰，秦東陽令史。嬰生成安君餘，餘生軌，軌生審，審生安，安生恒，恒生願，願四子：清、察、齊、尚。齊生源，源三子：寔、崱、邃。寔字仲弓，後漢大將軍掾屬，文範先生。六子：紀、夔、洽、諶、休、光。諶字季方，獻文先生。生青州刺史忠。二子：佐、和。佐二子：準、徽。準字道基，晉太尉、廣陵元公。生伯眕，建興中度江居曲阿新豐湖。生匡，二子：赤松、世達。世達，長城令，徙居長城下若里，生丞相掾康。康生盱眙太守英，英生尚書郎公弼，公弼生步兵校尉鼎，鼎生散騎侍郎高，高生懷安令詠，詠生安成太守猛，猛生太常卿道巨，道巨生文讚。文讚三子：談先、霸先、休先。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-xintangshu-071xia-chen-preface:p001:m0400","object_person_mention_id":"c-xintangshu-071xia-chen-preface:p001:m0395","source_term":"文讚三子：談先、霸先、休先"}],"interpretation_note":"新唐陳氏序完整本段明文讚三子談先、霸先、休先；只採已選近父子來源主張，保晚出族序資格，不接舜或陳寔遠譜。"}},{"id":"sko_1z7_fje_AA","label":"世祖","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"世祖","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered:p003:m0037","c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered:p004:m0046","c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0005","c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0007","c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0010","c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0012","c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0017"]},{"surface":"世祖文皇帝","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0001"]},{"surface":"蒨","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0002"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-013","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered","source_id":"s-chenshu-013-ws1511906-rendered-xunlang","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered:p003","quote":"世祖","mention_id":"c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered:p003:m0037"},{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-013","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered","source_id":"s-chenshu-013-ws1511906-rendered-xunlang","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered:p004","quote":"世祖","mention_id":"c-chenshu-013-xunlang-rendered:p004:m0046"},{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-003","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","source_id":"s-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001","quote":"世祖文皇帝","mention_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0001"},{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-003","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","source_id":"s-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001","quote":"蒨","mention_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0002"},{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-003","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","source_id":"s-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001","quote":"世祖","mention_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0005"},{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-003","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","source_id":"s-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001","quote":"世祖","mention_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0007"},{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-003","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","source_id":"s-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001","quote":"世祖","mention_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0010"},{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-003","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","source_id":"s-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001","quote":"世祖","mention_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0012"},{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-003","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","source_id":"s-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001","quote":"世祖","mention_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0017"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"本傳南皖拒王琳、高祖崩入纂的陳朝主語鏈；陳書3傳首明世祖文皇帝諱蒨字子華，L140南皖及L145高祖崩至自南皖即位閉環。現役世祖候選為宋／晉／齊／魏／梁等，無蒨；不可接梁元帝繹或齊賾。","family_path":{"parent_person_id":"sko_1z7_fje_A","connection":"father","source_assertion_id":"a-chen003-qian-father-daotan","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-003","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","source_id":"s-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001","quote":"世祖文皇帝諱蒨，字子華，始興昭烈王長子也。少沈敏有識量，美容儀，留意經史，舉動方雅，造次必遵禮法。高祖甚愛之，常稱「此兒吾宗之英秀也」。梁太清初，夢兩日鬥，一大一小，大者光滅墜地，色正黃，其大如斗，世祖因三分取一而懷之。侯景之亂，鄉人多依山湖寇抄，世祖獨保家無所犯。時亂日甚，乃避地臨安。及高祖舉義兵，侯景遣使收世祖及衡陽獻王，世祖乃密袖小刀，冀因入見而害景，至便屬吏，故其事不行。高祖大軍圍石頭，景欲加害者數矣，會景敗，世祖乃得出赴高祖營。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0001","object_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0003","source_term":"始興昭烈王長子"}],"interpretation_note":"陳書世祖完整傳首明始興昭烈王長子；父角色道談/道譚與新唐談先的同指維持可撤回來源資格，不把襲封當父子。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-003","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered","raw_mention_count":7,"mention_ids":["c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0001","c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0002","c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0005","c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0007","c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0010","c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0012","c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0017"],"paragraph_ids":["c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0001","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0001"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0002","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0002"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0005","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0005"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0007","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0007"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0010","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-rendered:p001:m0010"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-chenshu-003-qian-parent-re